{"sessions":[{"session":0,"messages":["Hey there! Just wanted to set something up for our future chats. Could you please always respond in French? That would be great.","By the way, people call me Maya Garcia. I spend my days creating designs at Notion. It's been my workplace since June 2024.","I'm based in Lisbon, though I originally come from somewhere else. My birthday falls on June 22, in case you were wondering.","Oh, and I have a sister named Priya Sharma. She's a part of my family."],"conveyed":["s0f5","s0f0","s0f1","s0f6","s0f2","s0f3","s0f4"]},{"session":1,"messages":["Hey again! Just thought I'd share some updates about myself. I've recently changed my coffee preferences - not a fan of oat milk lattes anymore. Now I just enjoy black coffee.","The same goes for my music taste. I used to be all about techno, but these days I'm more into lo-fi beats.","When I'm not working, I have some hobbies that keep me busy. Kayaking is one of them - there's something peaceful about being on the water.","I also enjoy a good game of chess. It's a nice mental exercise after a long day.","On the technical side, I've been dabbling with a few programming languages. Kotlin, Rust, and Go are all in my toolkit now."],"conveyed":["s1f0","s1f1","s1f5","s1f6","s1f2","s1f3","s1f4"]},{"session":2,"messages":["Just wanted to share some career news. I've moved on from Notion as of March 2025.","I've joined a new company called Ramp, also as a designer. It's been an exciting transition so far."],"conveyed":["s2f0","s2f1"]},{"session":3,"messages":["Another quick update about my life - I've relocated! I'm now living in Toronto as of September 2025.","It's quite a change from Lisbon, but I'm settling in nicely to the new city."],"conveyed":["s3f0"]},{"session":4,"messages":["Just wanted to mention that my manager at Ramp is Priya. She's been great to work with.","The team I'm on, the Payments team, is managed by Priya as well. We primarily work with Kotlin, which is interesting since it's one of my preferred languages.","I'm glad to be part of the Payments team - it's a challenging but rewarding project to work on."],"conveyed":["s4f0","s4f1","s4f2","s4f3"]},{"session":5,"messages":["Work update: I recently wrapped up Project Cedar in January 2026. It was a challenging but rewarding experience.","Right now, my focus is on Project Falcon. It's keeping me busy with new and interesting problems.","Before that, I also completed Project Fable back in April 2026."],"conveyed":["s5f0","s5f1","s5f2"]},{"session":6,"messages":["Just a quick personal update - I've welcomed a new furry friend into my life! I adopted a cat on September 25, 2025.","Work-wise, I had a significant achievement recently. I managed to rebuild our CI pipeline all by myself on April 27, 2026. It was quite the undertaking!"],"conveyed":["s6f0","s6f1"]},{"session":7,"messages":["Looking back, May 1, 2025 was quite a memorable day - I had the opportunity to speak at a conference. It was quite an experience.","More recently, on September 11, 2026, I successfully deployed the payment service. That was a big milestone for our team.","Oh, and another quick update - I've completely switched to lo-fi beats for my music listening. It's become my go-to choice these days."],"conveyed":["s7f0","s7f1","s7f2"]}]}
